<view class="page"><view class="top"><text class="back" bindtap="back">‹</text><view class="section-switch" bindtap="chooseSection"><text class="title">{{section === 'users' ? '用户管理' : '管理'}}</text><text>⌄</text></view></view><view class="profile"><view class="avatar">{{userInitial}}</view><view><text class="name">{{user.username || '微信用户'}}</text><text class="muted">个人 TREK 实例</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在读取管理员数据…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><block wx:else><view class="stats"><view><text>{{stats.totalUsers}}</text><small>用户</small></view><view><text>{{stats.totalTrips}}</text><small>行程</small></view><view><text>{{stats.totalPlaces}}</text><small>地点</small></view><view><text>{{stats.totalFiles}}</text><small>文件</small></view></view><view wx:if="{{section === 'users'}}" class="user-list"><view class="section-label">用户管理</view><view wx:for="{{users}}" wx:key="id" class="user-row"><view class="avatar small">{{item.initial}}</view><view class="user-copy"><text class="name">{{item.username || '未命名用户'}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.email || '微信账号'}} · {{item.role || 'user'}}</text></view><text class="online {{item.online ? 'yes' : ''}}">{{item.online ? '在线' : '离线'}}</text></view></view></block><view class="section"><view bindtap="openSettings"><text>⚙ 设置与外观</text><text>›</text></view><view bindtap="openNotifications"><text>♧ 通知中心</text><text>›</text></view></view><view class="notice"><text class="notice-title">小程序管理</text><text>插件、服务器配置、备份和权限矩阵仍可从 TREK 网页端管理员页面操作。</text></view><bottom-nav active="more" center-mode="logo" bind:create="back" /></view>
